      "title": "Song Talents — official Final Fantasy d20",
      "sourceKind": "official_web",
      "retrievedOn": "2026-10-28"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Ten total slots at even Bard levels 2–20; advanced talents are alternatives for slots at level 12+, not additional slots.",
    "An asterisk means at most ONE such talent modifies any single song, though a Bard may learn different asterisk talents.",
    "Attract Minion, Bard Training and Coordinate explicitly allow repeated selection; Coordinate is capped at +5.",
    "External feats, minion stats, spell/song effects and conditional combat bonuses remain manual until separate catalogs or sheet rules exist.",
    "Bard remains staged and cannot be selected for character saving until a verified Bard adapter and songs/jingles catalog exist."
  ],
